          "url": "https://mathverse-cuhk.github.io/",
          "accessed": "2026-11-07"
        }
      ]
    },
    "gap_in_prior_benchmarks": {
      "value": "现有视觉数学题常在文字中泄露图中信息，模型不看图也能答对。",
      "sources": [
